1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 17=

5
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:15,800
I'm full.

6
00:00:16,399 --> 00:00:17,239
I'd better head back.

7
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:18,760
Don't drink and drive.

8
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,719
I didn't drive here.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,719
I'll take a cab back.

10
00:00:25,079 --> 00:00:25,480
By the way,

11
00:00:26,039 --> 00:00:27,039
are you free tomorrow night?

12
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,640
Tomorrow night?

13
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:30,399
Why?

14
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,839
Zeng Ye and Wei Fanxing

15
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,920
insist I bring my wife

16
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,200
to their party tomorrow.

17
00:00:38,679 --> 00:00:39,920
Do I have to go?

18
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,799
They're my oldest friends.

19
00:00:43,679 --> 00:00:44,520
It's very casual.

20
00:00:45,719 --> 00:00:46,600
And if

21
00:00:47,719 --> 00:00:48,960
you feel uncomfortable,

22
00:00:49,359 --> 00:00:50,399
we can leave anytime.

23
00:00:52,799 --> 00:00:53,200
Okay.

24
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:54,719
See you tomorrow.

25
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:56,840
See you tomorrow.

26
00:00:57,359 --> 00:00:57,840
I'm off.

27
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:15,799
(Under those fireworks,)

28
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,680
(my heart was racing.)

29
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:19,439
(Am I...)

30
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,319
(really falling for him?)

31
00:01:29,719 --> 00:01:30,359
Xifeng.

32
00:01:30,959 --> 00:01:31,480
Ms. Lin.

33
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:32,959
What are you doing here?

34
00:01:34,079 --> 00:01:35,439
Mr. Xie didn't want you
taking a cab alone.

35
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:37,200
He sent me to take you to the Guses'.

36
00:01:41,460 --> 00:01:42,460
Okay.

37
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,000
Hua,

38
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:54,519
I want to buy Gu Zheng a house.

39
00:01:54,719 --> 00:01:56,079
Help me choose one today.

40
00:01:57,080 --> 00:01:58,080
Okay.

41
00:01:59,719 --> 00:02:02,239
Why did you rush out last night?

42
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:06,599
Did Gu Zheng say something awful again?

43
00:02:07,959 --> 00:02:09,080
Tell me the truth.

44
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,800
I'll set him straight.

45
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:12,360
No.

46
00:02:13,159 --> 00:02:15,560
My director called last night.

47
00:02:15,879 --> 00:02:16,840
There was an important document

48
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:17,960
I had to go back and deal with.

49
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,159
That's why I was in a hurry.

50
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:21,520
You just started,
and they're working you so hard.

51
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,000
Overtime every day

52
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,159
must be exhausting.

53
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,240
If it's too much,

54
00:02:26,599 --> 00:02:27,520
just come home.

55
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:29,400
I'll look after you for life.

56
00:02:29,759 --> 00:02:31,120
You don't have to suffer like that.

57
00:02:31,719 --> 00:02:33,039
I'm really fine.

58
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,680
I like having a busy, fulfilling life.

59
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:38,479
And I'm learning so much.

60
00:02:39,159 --> 00:02:41,520
I can see it perfectly well.

61
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:43,639
That son of mine

62
00:02:44,439 --> 00:02:46,039
let money cloud his judgment.

63
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:48,680
He still has feelings for you,

64
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:52,240
but he gave in to his greed

65
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:53,680
and chose Li Sirong.

66
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:55,439
At the end of the day,

67
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,000
he just wasn't lucky enough

68
00:02:58,039 --> 00:02:59,599
to deserve a girl as good as you.

69
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:02,639
But don't worry.

70
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:05,400
I've been finding you dates.

71
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,719
Young men from respectable families,

72
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:08,840
with good character,

73
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,360
who know how to treat a girl right.

74
00:03:10,879 --> 00:03:12,599
Every one of them
is better than Gu Zheng.

75
00:03:13,599 --> 00:03:14,039
Sirong,

76
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:15,639
I heard Mrs. Gu

77
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,479
is choosing a house for Gu Zheng today.

78
00:03:19,479 --> 00:03:21,360
It must be your marital home.

79
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:29,240
Sirong.

80
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,400
When you're free,

81
00:03:32,759 --> 00:03:34,120
I'll arrange for you to meet them.

82
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,960
We'll find someone who truly loves you.

83
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,439
No need, Mrs. Gu.

84
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:43,840
I just want to live my life

85
00:03:44,039 --> 00:03:44,680
and focus on work.

86
00:03:45,199 --> 00:03:46,159
I'm not thinking about dating.

87
00:03:47,039 --> 00:03:47,439
Well...

88
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:49,039
Let's look at the houses first.

89
00:03:51,639 --> 00:03:53,759
She's still clinging to Mrs. Gu.

90
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,080
Trying so hard to suck up to her.

91
00:03:56,599 --> 00:03:57,919
It's awful.

92
00:03:59,439 --> 00:04:00,919
She moved back in last night.

93
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,439
Gu Zheng was home with her
the whole time.

94
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:05,520
Now she's all over
my future mother-in-law.

95
00:04:05,919 --> 00:04:07,199
What a cheap trick.

96
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,759
I'm going to the restroom.

97
00:04:10,039 --> 00:04:10,919
Have a look around.

98
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:12,759
Come on.

99
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:13,840
Let's teach her a lesson.

100
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,000
Lin Hua,

101
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,079
move out of the Gu house. Now.

102
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,439
Or you'll regret it.

103
00:04:32,079 --> 00:04:32,600
Li Siyan,

104
00:04:33,639 --> 00:04:34,759
I thought you'd learned something.

105
00:04:35,399 --> 00:04:37,399
Still throwing your weight around?

106
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,800
Don't talk to my sister like that!

107
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,839
How dare you hit my sister!

108
00:04:46,199 --> 00:04:46,560
You...

109
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,720
Have you two lost your minds?

110
00:04:50,199 --> 00:04:51,360
For the last time,

111
00:04:51,879 --> 00:04:53,519
Gu Zheng and I are done.

112
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,160
He's the one who won't leave me alone.

113
00:04:56,319 --> 00:04:57,879
You can't keep him in line,

114
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,240
so you come here and take it out on me?

115
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:00,720
I'm warning you.

116
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,639
I have old pictures of you two.

117
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,079
If you...

118
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,160
If you don't move out,

119
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,199
I'll post them.

120
00:05:06,839 --> 00:05:08,519
I'll ruin you and the Gu family.

121
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,079
Old pictures of me?

122
00:05:14,279 --> 00:05:14,759
Fine.

123
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,600
Go ahead. Post them.

124
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,399
I've done nothing wrong.

125
00:05:18,519 --> 00:05:19,480
But you?

126
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:23,319
Jealous and violent,
and not even married yet.

127
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,519
If word gets out,

128
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:27,439
which family looks worse,

129
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,800
the Gus or the Lis?

130
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,519
Sirong.

131
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:07,959
♪Woke up this morning♪

132
00:06:07,959 --> 00:06:09,399
You're here so soon.

133
00:06:09,959 --> 00:06:11,399
I wanted to touch up my makeup.

134
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:20,439
♪Am I still dreaming♪

135
00:06:20,439 --> 00:06:21,079
Who did this?

136
00:06:24,079 --> 00:06:24,759
It's nothing.

137
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,800
I'll find out even if you won't tell me.

138
00:06:27,639 --> 00:06:28,360
Go find Bao'er first.

139
00:06:42,471 --> 00:06:46,497
♪It's the new life I've chosen♪

140
00:06:47,119 --> 00:06:49,797
♪No more tears to hold back♪

141
00:06:50,251 --> 00:06:53,670
♪No more anger inside♪

142
00:06:54,958 --> 00:06:56,940
♪It's a new♪

143
00:06:56,940 --> 00:06:58,783
♪Horizon♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

144
00:06:59,657 --> 00:07:02,541
♪And I'll follow this track♪

145
00:07:02,565 --> 00:07:04,280
♪With all my faith♪

146
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,751
♪And all my pride♪

147
00:07:19,988 --> 00:07:23,399
♪Now I've found a reason♪

148
00:07:24,656 --> 00:07:28,635
♪To believe♪

149
00:07:32,693 --> 00:07:35,615
♪It's the new life I've chosen♪

150
00:07:37,143 --> 00:07:41,810
♪To live♪
